# These variables are currently UNUSED by the application code.
#
# The Supabase URL and publishable (anon) key are pinned directly in
# src/integrations/supabase/client.ts. That pinning was introduced after the
# Lovable integration twice regenerated .env to point at the retired
# pre-migration project (tiornvtwymjhsrrpbwvr) — a build shipped from that
# state locked staff out and failed every clock-in with PGRST205
# "attendance_events not found".
#
# This SUPERSEDES the older rule in supabase/README.md that says .env must
# carry the Hive URL and key. That rule predates the pinning. Keeping the
# values in source is what makes .env rewrites harmless; nothing reads these.
#
# If you ever move back to env-driven config, update client.ts in the same
# change and confirm the ref is zbltbvizmlvotayjjcum (the live Hive database).

VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
